The files in this directory are the front-end of MusicD Remote (for Roon),
copied unmodified from https://github.com/meltface-80/MusicD-Remote (public/).

  Copyright (c) 2026 Lewis Menzies (Music Duck / MusicD)
  Released under the MIT License.

They are bundled here so the app presents the same interface. Every /api/...
request they make is answered by the Kotlin implementation in :core rather than
by the Node server they were written against. Endpoints this build does not
implement answer in the UI's own "feature is off" shape, so no screen is left
in an error state.

Keeping these files byte-identical to upstream is deliberate: it is what makes
pulling in a newer MusicD-Remote UI a copy rather than a merge.
